      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Fair comparison",
      "items": [
        "Both arms use the same provider and model",
        "Each run is stateless: no learning, no recall, no training capture",
        "Agentic tasks get a fresh sandboxed project per arm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "What is reported",
      "items": [
        "Pass rates with Wilson intervals, pass^k and consistency",
        "ECE and Brier from stated confidence; Isnad grades per arm",
        "Index weighted agents 30, coding 20, reasoning 20, general 30"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Against people",
      "items": [
